sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant W as WalletController
    participant T as TopUpWalletUseCase
    participant PS as PaymentServiceClient
    participant P as PaymentService
    participant H as PaymentCompletedHandler
    participant CR as CreditWalletUseCase
    participant R as WalletRepository

    Note over C, P: Phase 1: Initiation
    C->>W: POST /topup {amount, method}
    W->>T: execute(dto)
    T->>PS: createPayment(paymentDto)
    PS->>P: POST /api/payments
    P-->>PS: {paymentId, redirectUrl}
    PS-->>T: {paymentId, redirectUrl}
    T-->>W: {paymentId, redirectUrl}
    W-->>C: 200 OK {redirectUrl}

    Note over C, P: Phase 2: Completion (Async)
    P->>H: PaymentCompleted Event
    H->>CR: execute(creditDto)
    CR->>R: findByUserId(userId)
    R-->>CR: wallet
    CR->>R: update(wallet)
    R-->>CR: success
    CR-->>H: success
    Note right of H: Wallet Credited Successfully
